**/node_modules
**/dist
backend/prisma/dev.db
backend/prisma/dev.db-journal
# Glob on purpose (deploy checklist 2026-08-11: dev.db.template was missed).
# Every SQLite artifact starts with dev.db — the template, -wal/-shm sidecars,
# backup-*/snapshot-* copies — and named-file denylists here have already let
# files slip (see CLAUDE.md's packaging lesson). Nothing in the Docker build
# needs any of them: the cloud image is Postgres-only and is seeded from the
# owner's terminal, never from a bundled SQLite file.
backend/prisma/dev.db*
**/.env
**/.env.local
.git
